{"turn_id": "d24-t1", "session_id": "d24", "turn": 1, "answer": {"claims": [{"key": "training_dataset", "text": "论文在公开基准数据集“Quora Question Pairs”上进行实验，用于释义识别任务。", "citations": [{"paper_id": "1712.02555", "chunk_id": "c-70876748d6ad7c5c4f480427"}]}, {"key": "dev_dataset_threshold", "text": "论文使用在开发数据集（development dataset）中学习到的阈值，将余弦相似度二值化为释义/非释义。", "citations": [{"paper_id": "1712.02555", "chunk_id": "c-486c0ce43082d60933f2417a"}]}], "decision": "answer"}, "error": null, "trace_id": "d24-t1", "assessment": {"execution_success": true, "task_success": null, "pipeline_success": null, "behavior_match": true, "schema_valid": true, "stage_flow_valid": true, "citation_structure_valid": true, "memory_committed": true, "nlu_correct": true, "reflect_correct": null, "retrieval_effective": true, "generate_valid": true, "degraded": false}}
{"turn_id": "d24-t2", "session_id": "d24", "turn": 2, "answer": {"claims": [{"key": "experiment_dataset_task", "text": "论文在公开基准数据集“Quora Question Pairs”上进行实验，任务为释义识别（paraphrase identification）。", "citations": [{"paper_id": "1712.02555", "chunk_id": "c-70876748d6ad7c5c4f480427"}]}, {"key": "pipeline_three_steps", "text": "模型分三步完成任务：先用 BiLSTM 将输入句子解析为隐表示；再由 Hungarian layer 利用隐表示抽取对齐的未匹配部分；最后用余弦相似度度量这些对齐的未匹配部分以作最终判别。", "citations": [{"paper_id": "1712.02555", "chunk_id": "c-70876748d6ad7c5c4f480427"}]}, {"key": "outperforms_baselines", "text": "实验结果显示该模型在 Quora Question Pairs 上显著且大幅优于其他基线，作者称这验证了其关于“对齐的未匹配部分”的理论并说明了方法的有效性。", "citations": [{"paper_id": "1712.02555", "chunk_id": "c-70876748d6ad7c5c4f480427"}]}, {"key": "binary_threshold_dev", "text": "为进一步评估准确率，论文还使用一个在开发集（development dataset）上学习得到的阈值，将余弦相似度二值化为“释义/非释义”。", "citations": [{"paper_id": "1712.02555", "chunk_id": "c-486c0ce43082d60933f2417a"}]}, {"key": "cosine_range_interpretation", "text": "输出余弦匹配分数的取值范围为 [-1,1]，取值 1 表示两句相似/为释义，取值 -1 表示相反。", "citations": [{"paper_id": "1712.02555", "chunk_id": "c-486c0ce43082d60933f2417a"}]}, {"key": "case_study_setting", "text": "论文在“Quora Question Pairs”实际场景下做了案例研究：斜线网格表示对齐的匹配部分，叉形网格表示对齐的未匹配部分；案例研究将对相似度低于某阈值的配对标记为未匹配。", "citations": [{"paper_id": "1712.02555", "chunk_id": "c-f2c31c48060de190a862f031"}]}, {"key": "case_paraphrase_example", "text": "案例 (a) 的两句为“What is your review of Hidden Figures (2016 movie)”与“What are your impressions of Hidden Figures (2017 movie)”，多数对齐部分匹配、少量对齐未匹配部分相似，模型据此判为释义。", "citations": [{"paper_id": "1712.02555", "chunk_id": "c-f2c31c48060de190a862f031"}]}, {"key": "case_nonparaphrase_example", "text": "案例 (b) 中“imported/unknown”与“Austria/Japan”两处未匹配部分相互冲突，因此被判为非释义。", "citations": [{"paper_id": "1712.02555", "chunk_id": "c-f2c31c48060de190a862f031"}]}, {"key": "case_study_conclusion", "text": "论文总结该案例研究支持其假设：“对齐的未匹配部分在语义上是关键的”。", "citations": [{"paper_id": "1712.02555", "chunk_id": "c-f2c31c48060de190a862f031"}]}, {"key": "motivation_aligned_unmatched", "text": "论文认为注意力这类 soft-max 加权技术虽能挑出最相似/最不相似的部分，却弱于建模“对齐的未匹配部分”，而后者是识别释义的关键证据。", "citations": [{"paper_id": "1712.02555", "chunk_id": "c-960c4cb907b38a179597b601"}]}], "decision": "answer"}, "error": null, "trace_id": "d24-t2", "assessment": {"execution_success": true, "task_success": null, "pipeline_success": null, "behavior_match": true, "schema_valid": true, "stage_flow_valid": true, "citation_structure_valid": true, "memory_committed": true, "nlu_correct": true, "reflect_correct": null, "retrieval_effective": true, "generate_valid": true, "degraded": false}}
